    Xinguo Ren, Patrick Rinke, Volker Blum, Juergen Wieferink, Alex Tkatchenko,
    Andrea Sanfilippo, Karsten Reuter, and Matthias Scheffler,
    'Resolution-of-identity approach to Hartree-Fock, hybrid density functionals,
    RPA, MP2, and GW with numeric atom-centered orbital basis functions'
    New Journal of Physics 14, 053020 (2012).
    http://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/14/5/053020


  For using hybrid functionals or Hartree-Fock in FHI-aims, please cite

    Sergey V. Levchenko, Xinguo Ren, Juergen Wieferink, Rainer Joahanni,
    Patrick Rinke, Volker Blum, and Matthias Scheffler
    Hybrid functionals for large periodic systems in an all-electron,
    numeric atom-centered basis framework

    Comput. Phys. Commun. 192, 60-69 (2015)
